{"ticker":"LYB","updated":"2026-11-14T01:12:22Z","profile":{"longName":"LyondellBasell Industries N.V.","shortName":"LyondellBasell Industries NV","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","country":"Netherlands","website":"https://www.lyondellbasell.com","fullTimeEmployees":18970,"marketCap":20826513408,"trailingPE":15.600484,"forwardPE":10.07963,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.65156156,"pegRatio":1.53,"targetMeanPrice":72.27778,"targetHighPrice":93.0,"targetLowPrice":58.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.1,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.14563,"operatingMargins":0.09192,"profitMargins":0.040510003,"totalRevenue":31964000256,"beta":0.319,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":83.94,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":42.01,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.32},"summary":"LyondellBasell Industries N.V. operates as a chemical company in the United States, Germany, China, Mexico, Italy, Japan, France, Poland, the Netherlands, and internationally. It operates in five segments: Olefins and PolyolefinsAmericas; Olefins and PolyolefinsEurope, Asia, International; Intermediates and Derivatives; Advanced Polymer Solutions; and Technology. The company produces and markets olefins and co-products, such as ethylene, aromatics, propylene and butadiene; polyolefins; polyethylene; polypropylene homopolymers and copolymers; propylene oxide and derivatives; oxyfuels and related products; and intermediate chemicals, such as styrene monomer and acetyls. It also produces and markets compounding and solutions, including polypropylene compounds, engineered plastics, masterbatches, and engineered composites and colors. In addition, it develops and licenses chemical and polyolefin process technologies; and manufactures and sells polyolefin catalysts and serves food packaging, home furnishings, automotive components, and paints and coatings applications. LyondellBasell Industries N.V. was incorporated in 2009 and is headquartered in Rotterdam, the Netherlands.","summary_zh":"LyondellBasell Industries N.V. 作為一家化學公司在美國、德國、中國、墨西哥、義大利、日本、法國、波蘭、荷蘭和國際上開展業務。它的業務分為五個部門：烯烴和聚烯烴——美洲；烯烴和聚烯烴——歐洲、亞洲、國際；中間體和衍生物；先進聚合物解決方案；和技術。該公司生產和銷售烯烴及聯產品，如乙烯、芳烴、丙烯和丁二烯；聚烯烴；聚乙烯；聚丙烯均聚物和共聚物；環氧丙烷及其衍生物；富氧燃料及相關產品；以及中間化學品，例如苯乙烯單體和乙醯基。它還生產和銷售複合材料和解決方案，包括聚丙烯複合材料、工程塑膠、色母粒以及工程複合材料和顏色。此外，它還開發並許可化學和聚烯烴加工技術；生產和銷售聚烯烴催化劑，服務於食品包裝、家居用品、汽車零件以及油漆和塗料應用。 LyondellBasell Industries N.V. 成立於 2009 年，總部位於荷蘭鹿特丹。","sector_zh":"基礎材料","industry_zh":"特種化學品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":55.75,"h":55.84,"l":52.43,"c":52.58,"v":6260500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":52.95,"h":53.69,"l":52.51,"c":52.65,"v":5786000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":52.68,"h":55.17,"l":52.3,"c":53.52,"v":7335600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":54.21,"h":54.37,"l":52.5,"c":52.69,"v":4546400},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":52.49,"h":52.69,"l":51.65,"c":52.01,"v":7830800},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":51.76,"h":51.78,"l":50.81,"c":51.1,"v":4996600},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":51.46,"h":51.76,"l":50.35,"c":50.37,"v":4782600},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":50.76,"h":51.89,"l":50.67,"c":51.37,"v":3918000},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":51.03,"h":51.15,"l":48.94,"c":48.98,"v":5703700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":49.23,"h":50.58,"l":49.2,"c":49.45,"v":6208300},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":49.63,"h":49.63,"l":48.58,"c":49.08,"v":5817000},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":48.85,"h":49.05,"l":48.13,"c":49.04,"v":4708100},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":48.73,"h":49.11,"l":48.07,"c":48.42,"v":4193300},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":48.64,"h":50.05,"l":48.5,"c":49.33,"v":4812000},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":49.45,"h":49.98,"l":48.9,"c":49.47,"v":2652200},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":49.93,"h":49.93,"l":48.64,"c":48.68,"v":2876400},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":48.95,"h":49.6,"l":48.07,"c":49.13,"v":6087500},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":49.14,"h":49.47,"l":48.54,"c":48.69,"v":3016700},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":48.96,"h":48.99,"l":47.31,"c":47.67,"v":4485000},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":47.57,"h":47.99,"l":44.89,"c":44.91,"v":5922800},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":45.5,"h":46.69,"l":45.48,"c":46.27,"v":4562700},{"t":"2025-10-14","o"